:volu world BOX 500*cm 500*cm 500*cm G4_Galactic
:vis world OFF
:volu room BOX 300*cm 300*cm 300*cm G4_AIR
:vis room OFF

:rotm r000 0 0 0
:rotm r90x 90 0 0

:volu scintillator BOX 5*cm 5.08*cm 5*cm G4_Plastic_Scintillator

:place room 1 world r000 0 0 0
:place scintillator 2 room r000 0 0 0
:color scintillator 0.5 0.5 0.5
